  diagnosisChoices:
  - diseaseId: GASTRITIS
    diagnosisName: Gastrit
    resultText: "Gastritte epigastrik a\u011Fr\u0131, mide bulant\u0131s\u0131 ve
      yemekle ili\u015Fkili mide rahats\u0131zl\u0131\u011F\u0131 g\xF6r\xFClebilir.
      Ancak bu vakada bo\u011Faza do\u011Fru yanma, yat\u0131nca art\u0131\u015F
      ve a\u011Fza ek\u015Fi s\u0131v\u0131 gelmesi refl\xFCy\xFC daha g\xFC\xE7l\xFC
      d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFCr\xFCr."
    isCorrectDiagnosis: 0
    recommendedTags:
    - epigastric_discomfort
    - nausea_mild
    - postprandial_increase
  - diseaseId: PEPTIC_ULCER
    diagnosisName: "Peptik \xDClser "
    resultText: "Peptik \xFClserde a\xE7l\u0131k a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131, gece epigastrik
      a\u011Fr\u0131 ve H. pylori pozitifli\u011Fi beklenebilir. Bu hastada a\xE7ken
      belirginle\u015Fen \xFClser tipi a\u011Fr\u0131 yoktur ve H. pylori testi negatiftir."
    isCorrectDiagnosis: 0
    recommendedTags:
    - fasting_pain
    - night_epigastric_pain
    - hpylori_positive
  - diseaseId: GERD
    diagnosisName: "Refl\xFC"
    resultText: "Hastan\u0131n yemek sonras\u0131 ve yat\u0131nca artan yanma \u015Fikayeti,
      a\u011Fza ek\u015Fi/ac\u0131 s\u0131v\u0131 gelmesi, sabah ses k\u0131s\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131
      ve antiasit ile rahatlamas\u0131 GERD ile uyumludur. Endoskopide distal \xF6zofagusta
      hafif irritasyon g\xF6r\xFClmesi de refl\xFCy\xFC destekler."
    isCorrectDiagnosis: 1
    recommendedTags:
    - heartburn
    - postprandial_increase
    - worse_lying_down
    - acid_regurgitation
    - morning_hoarseness
    - antacid_response
    - distal_esophageal_irritation
  - diseaseId: PHARYNGITIS
    diagnosisName: Farenjit
    resultText: "Bo\u011Faz yanmas\u0131 farenjit ile kar\u0131\u015Fabilir; ancak
      ate\u015F, yutkunurken artan a\u011Fr\u0131, belirgin farengeal hiperemi veya
      enfeksiyon laboratuvar bulgular\u0131 yoktur. Bu nedenle farenjit daha zay\u0131f
      bir tan\u0131d\u0131r."
    isCorrectDiagnosis: 0
    recommendedTags:
    - odynophagia_yes
    - fever_yes
    - pharyngeal_hyperemia
    - crp_high
